1:06:421 Stunde, 6 Minuten, 42 SekundenBut let me push this even further because there's another line of research that I find genuinely mindbending. And
1:06:491 Stunde, 6 Minuten, 49 Sekundenit has to do with what happens not just when you learn a second language, but when you lose one or when you have two languages competing in real time.
1:07:011 Stunde, 7 Minuten, 1 SekundeThere's a phenomenon called language attrition.
