2:03:032 Stunden, 3 Minuten, 3 SekundenBut it lives so close to your thinking, so woven into the texture of your experience that the line between the two
2:03:112 Stunden, 3 Minuten, 11 Sekundenis almost impossible to find. Your words are not your thoughts. But your thoughts would not be quite the same without your words. And that's not a limitation.
